<problem>
<!-- <title>discrete equilibria 4</title> -->

<setup>

<selectFromSequence name="a" from="1" to=" 5" />
<selectFromSequence name="b" from="1" to=" 30" />
<select name="x"> x y z u v w p X Y Z S</select>
<math name="answer">$a </math>
<math name="A" simplify="full">$a **3</math>

</setup>


<p>Find all equilibria to the discrete dynamical system below.  If there are multiple equilibria, separate your answers by commas.  
<md>
  <mrow>$x _{n+1} \amp = $x _n - $x _n^3 + $A</mrow>
  <mrow>$x _0 \amp = $b</mrow>
</md>
</p>

<p><m>E =</m> 
<answer>
<award symbolicEquality="true">$answer </award>
</answer>
</p>


<solution>
<p>To find the equilibria, we set <m>$x _{n+1} = E</m> and <m>$x _n = E</m> in the evolution rule, obtaining
<md>
  <mrow>E\amp = E - E^3 + $A </mrow>
  <mrow>E^3\amp =$A </mrow>
</md>
Therefore, the equilibrium is <m>E=\sqrt[3]{ $A  } =$a </m>.</p>


</solution>


</problem>